---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import HackathonNav from "../../components/HackathonNav.astro";
import { sponsorInterestUrl, SPONSORSHIP_CONTACT_EMAIL, sponsorshipTiers, sponsors, confirmedSponsors, prizePools, independence, sponsorWorkflow, sponsorshipFaq } from "../../data/hackathonSponsorship";
import { asset, href } from "../../data/project";
import "../../styles/hackathon-experience.css";
const publicSponsors = confirmedSponsors(sponsors);
const pools = prizePools(sponsors);
---
<Layout title="Sponsor the AeglysAI AI/ML and Cybersecurity Hackathon" description="Support open-source engineering challenges exploring adaptive authorization, behavioral intelligence and resilient distributed systems.">
<div class="hackathon-experience">
  <section class="hx-hero"><div class="container">
    <p class="hx-eyebrow">AEGLYSAI AI/ML AND CYBERSECURITY HACKATHON</p>
    <h1>Support the Next Generation<br/><span class="hx-emphasis">of Secure Systems Builders</span></h1>
    <p class="hx-lead">Help students, engineers and researchers build, test and explore adaptive security and resilient distributed systems.</p>
    <div class="hx-actions">{sponsorInterestUrl ? <a class="hx-button hx-primary" href={sponsorInterestUrl}>Become a Sponsor</a> : <div><button class="hx-button hx-primary" disabled aria-describedby="sponsor-form-note">Become a Sponsor</button><span class="hx-opening" id="sponsor-form-note">Sponsorship Interest Form — Opening Soon</span></div>}<a class="hx-button" href="#options">View Sponsorship Options</a></div>
    <p class="hx-fine">Sponsorship helps support prizes, community activities and technical learning opportunities. AeglysAI is an open-source research and engineering initiative; acceptance and recognition require private review and written agreement.</p>
  </div></section>
  <div class="container hx-content"><HackathonNav/>
    <section class="hx-section" aria-labelledby="why-sponsor"><p class="hx-eyebrow">WHY SPONSOR</p><h2 id="why-sponsor">Support engineering in the open.</h2><div class="hx-grid hx-tracks">
      <article class="hx-card"><h3>SUPPORT OPEN ENGINEERING</h3><p>Help participants explore real engineering and security problems.</p></article>
      <article class="hx-card"><h3>ENABLE STUDENT PARTICIPATION</h3><p>Support accessible technical learning and experimentation.</p></article>
      <article class="hx-card"><h3>GROW OPEN-SOURCE COMMUNITY</h3><p>Encourage contributors around AeglysAI and related research challenges.</p></article>
      <article class="hx-card"><h3>SUPPORT THE PRIZE POOL</h3><p>Confirmed sponsorship may increase hackathon prizes and community resources.</p></article>
    </div></section>
    <section class="hx-section" id="options" aria-labelledby="options-heading"><p class="hx-eyebrow">PROPOSED / CONFIGURABLE TIERS</p><h2 id="options-heading">Choose a way to contribute.</h2><p class="hx-section-copy">USD thresholds are proposals, not payment requests or accepted agreements. Scope, timing and recognition must be agreed in writing. {publicSponsors.length === 0 ? "No sponsor currently exists in the public configuration." : "Recognition is subject to agreed scope."}</p><div class="hx-grid hx-tracks">{sponsorshipTiers.map(tier => <article class="hx-card"><span class="hx-status">PROPOSED</span><h3>{tier.name}</h3><p class="hx-eyebrow">USD ${tier.minimumUsd.toLocaleString("en-US")}+</p><ul>{tier.recognition.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="hx-section" aria-labelledby="prize-pools"><p class="hx-eyebrow">BASE AWARD / VERIFIED ADDITIONS</p><h2 id="prize-pools">Prize pool transparency.</h2><p>The existing proposal retains a planned $300 base award for the single hackathon; funding is unconfirmed. Confirmed sponsorship may increase the available prize pool.</p><p class="hx-fine">The base is the existing planned USD $300 award, not evidence of payment or verified funding. Prize eligibility and payment are subject to official event rules. {pools.every(pool => pool.additional === 0) ? "No additional sponsorship is confirmed." : "Additional allocations shown below are confirmed."}</p><div class="hx-grid">{pools.map(pool => <article class="hx-card"><h3>{pool.event.title}</h3><p>Base Prize: USD ${pool.base}</p><p>Confirmed Additional Sponsorship: USD ${pool.additional}</p><p>Current Prize Pool: USD ${pool.total} · {pool.additional ? "includes confirmed additional funding" : "PLANNED BASE"}</p></article>)}</div><p class="hx-fine">Only confirmed cash allocated to the applicable event increases these totals. In-kind resources are considered separately; monetary value is not published without verification and agreement.</p></section>
    <section class="hx-callout" aria-labelledby="independence-heading"><p class="hx-eyebrow">SPONSORSHIP &amp; INDEPENDENCE</p><h2 id="independence-heading">Support is separate from decisions.</h2><p>Sponsorship does not purchase or influence:</p><ul>{independence.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul><p>Judges evaluate submissions under the published judging rubric. Sponsor representatives may judge only through the normal selection process and conflict-of-interest rules, including recusal. Sponsorship itself does not guarantee a judging position.</p></section>
    <section class="hx-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading"><h2 id="privacy-heading">Participant privacy and ownership.</h2><p>Sponsors do not automatically receive participant email addresses, phone numbers, application responses, judge information, private submissions, private scoring or personal data. Future sharing requires appropriate consent and a separately documented process. Google Form and Sheet responses remain private.</p><p>Sponsorship does not automatically transfer ownership of AeglysAI IP, participant code or submissions, research or documentation. Any separate IP arrangement requires a separate written agreement. No ownership of participant submissions is granted by a sponsorship tier.</p></section>
    <section class="hx-section" aria-labelledby="certificate-heading"><h2 id="certificate-heading">Certificate acknowledgement.</h2><p>Participant, finalist and winner digital certificates may acknowledge support only when sponsorship is confirmed, written terms include certificate branding rights, the sponsor approves its name/logo use and the organizer approves the final design.</p><p>Possible footer wording: “Community Hackathon supported by [Sponsor Name]” or “Prize supported by [Sponsor Name]”. These are wording examples, not configured sponsors.</p><p>Acknowledgement must not overpower AeglysAI, the participant name, achievement or event title. AeglysAI remains the certificate issuer unless otherwise formally agreed. Sponsorship neither earns achievement certificates nor changes eligibility.</p><a class="hx-link" href={`${href("hackathons")}#certificates`}>Certificate eligibility framework →</a></section>
    <section class="hx-section" aria-labelledby="process-heading"><p class="hx-eyebrow">MANUAL REVIEW / NO AUTOMATIC ACCEPTANCE</p><h2 id="process-heading">From interest to agreed support.</h2><ol>{sponsorWorkflow.map(step => <li>{step}</li>)}</ol><p class="hx-fine">The Google interest form feeds private organizer review, discussion and clarification. Both parties agree written terms before contribution confirmation and public recognition. No online payment, authentication or database is implemented.</p></section>
    <section class="hx-section" aria-labelledby="supporters-heading"><p class="hx-eyebrow">OUR SUPPORTERS</p><h2 id="supporters-heading">Community support.</h2>{publicSponsors.length ? <div class="hx-grid">{publicSponsors.map(sponsor => <article class="hx-card"><span class="hx-status">CONFIRMED</span>{sponsor.logo && <img src={asset(sponsor.logo.path)} alt={sponsor.logo.alt} width="160" height="80" loading="lazy"/>}<h3>{sponsor.name}</h3>{sponsor.website && <a class="hx-link" href={sponsor.website}>Sponsor website</a>}</article>)}</div> : <p>Community sponsorship opportunities are currently open.</p>}</section>
    <section class="hx-section" aria-labelledby="sponsor-faq"><h2 id="sponsor-faq">Sponsorship FAQ.</h2><div class="hx-faq">{sponsorshipFaq.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
    <section class="hx-final" aria-labelledby="contact-heading"><p class="hx-eyebrow">CONTACT / NEXT STEP</p><h2 id="contact-heading">Discuss support before committing.</h2>{SPONSORSHIP_CONTACT_EMAIL ? <a class="hx-link" href={`mailto:${SPONSORSHIP_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>Contact sponsorship organizer</a> : <p>Approved sponsorship contact: TBD / Contact Organizer. No contact address is configured.</p>}{sponsorInterestUrl ? <a class="hx-button hx-primary" href={sponsorInterestUrl}>Become a Sponsor</a> : <p>Sponsorship Interest Form — Opening Soon.</p>}<p>Refunds, cancellation and postponement provisions require legal/organizer review before acceptance.</p><a class="hx-button" href={href("hackathons")}>Back to the Hackathon Series</a></section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
